hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1497","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kuttay qatl karnay ka hukm detay hue suna. Aap farmatay thay: Saanpon aur kutton ko qatl karo, aur do lakeeron walay aur dum katay ko qatl karo, beshak ye donon beenai uchak letay hain aur hamilaon ka hamal gira detay hain. Zuhri ne kaha: Aur ham samajhtay hain ke ye un ke zehar ki wajah se hai, Allah zyada janta hai. Salim ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha: To main raha, koi saanp jo main dekhta usay qatl kiye baghair na chhorta. To jabke main aik din gharon walay saanp ka peecha kar raha tha ke mujh par Zaid bin Khattab ya Abu Lubaba guzray jabke main us ka peecha kar raha tha. To unhon ne kaha: Tehro, Ae Abdullah! To main ne kaha: Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein qatl karnay ka hukm diya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne gharon walayon se mana farmaya hai. (Muslim: 7/38). Baab: Gharon mein rehnay walayon ko teen din mohlat dena. (Zu-tafiyatain se murad saanp ki peeth par do safed lakeerein hain, abtar dum kata hai; murad ye hai ke wo dekh nay se beenai le jatay hain; hamila khauf se hamal gira deti hai.)"
"1498","[AI-translation] Abus Saib, Hisham bin Zuhra ke azaad kardah, se riwayat hai ke wo Abu Sa'id Khudri ke paas un ke ghar mein dakhil hue. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne unhein namaz padhtay paya. To main baith gaya aur un ka intezar karnay laga yahan tak ke wo apni namaz poori karein. To main ne ghar ke konay mein khajoor ki tehniyon mein harkat suni. To main ne mur kar dekha to saanp tha. To main usay qatl karnay ke liye utha. To unhon ne mujhe ishara kiya ke baith jao. To main baith gaya. Phir jab wo farigh hue to unhon ne ghar mein aik ghar ki taraf ishara kiya aur kaha: Kya tum ye ghar dekhtay ho? To main ne kaha: Haan. To unhon ne kaha: Us mein ham mein se aik naujawan tha jo nai dulha tha. Unhon ne kaha: To ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Khandaq ki taraf niklay. To wo naujawan Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se din ke darmiyan mein apne ghar walon ke paas wapas janay ki ijazat maangta tha. To us ne aik din ijazat maangi. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Apna hathyar le lo, beshak mujhe tum par Quraiza ka khauf hai. To wo mard apna hathyar le kar wapas gaya. To us ne apni biwi ko donon darwazon ke darmiyan khadi paya. To us ne us ki taraf nezay se qasd kiya taake usay us se chheday, aur usay ghairat aayi. To us ne us se kaha: Apna neza rok lo aur ghar mein dakhil ho taake dekho kis ne mujhe nikala hai. To wo dakhil hua to wahan bistar par bara saanp kunḍli maray hue tha. To us ne us ki taraf nezay se qasd kiya aur usay us mein piro diya. Phir wo nikla aur usay ghar mein gaad diya. To wo us par tarpa. To maloom na hua ke donon mein se kaun pehle mara, saanp ya naujawan. Unhon ne kaha: To ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap se ye zikr kiya aur kaha: Allah se dua kijiye ke wo usay hamaray liye zinda kar de. To Aap ne farmaya: Apne saathi ke liye bakhshish mango. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Madina mein jin hain jo Musalman ho gaye hain. To jab tum un mein se kuch dekho to usay teen din mohlat do. Phir agar us ke baad tumhein zaahir ho to usay qatl karo, beshak wo shaitaan hai. (Muslim: 7/40-41). (Urjoon khajoor ke khoshay ki tehni hai; Muslim mein qaala hai.)"
"1499","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath ghaar mein thay jabke Aap par Wal-mursalaat urfa naazil hui thi. To ham usay Aap ke munh se taza le rahay thay ke ham par saanp nikla. To Aap ne farmaya: Usay qatl karo. To ham usay qatl karnay ke liye dauday magar wo ham se aagay nikal gaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne usay tumharay shar se bachaya jaisa us ne tumhein us ke shar se bachaya. (Muslim: 7/40). Baab: Chhipkaliyon ko qatl karnay ke baaray mein."
"1500","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chhipkali ko qatl karnay ka hukm diya aur usay nuqsan pahunchanay wali kaha. (Muslim: 7/42). (Wazagh harkat ke saath, jisay saam abras kehtay hain.)"
"1501","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo pehli waar mein chhipkali qatl karay to us ke liye itni itni neki hai, aur jo usay doosri waar mein qatl karay to us ke liye itni itni neki hai pehli se kam, aur agar usay teesri waar mein qatl karay to us ke liye itni itni neki hai doosri se kam. Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke jo pehli waar mein chhipkali qatl karay us ke liye sau nekiyan likhi gayeen, doosri mein us se kam aur teesri mein us se kam. (Muslim: 7/42-43). Baab: Cheentiyon ko qatl karnay ke baaray mein."
"1502","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Nabiyon mein se aik Nabi darakht ke neechay utray. To unhein cheenti ne kaata. To unhon ne apna samaan mangwaya aur usay us ke neechay se nikala gaya. Phir unhon ne us ka hukm diya to wo jalayi gayi. Aik riwayat mein hai ke cheentiyon ki basti ka hukm diya. To Allah ne un ki taraf wahi ki: Kya aik cheenti nahi (maar saktay thay)? (Muslim: 7/43). Baab: Billi ko qatl karnay ke baaray mein. (Khshaash se murad keerey makoray hain.)"
"1503","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik aurat ko billi ki wajah se azaab diya gaya jisay us ne qaid kiya yahan tak ke wo mar gayi. To wo us ki wajah se aag mein dakhil hui. Na us ne usay khilaya aur pilaya jab usay qaid kiya, aur na us ne usay chhora ke wo zameen ke keerey makoray khati. (Muslim: 7/43). Baab: Choohay ke baaray mein aur ke wo maskh hai."
"1504","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bani Israil ki aik ummat gum ho gayi, maloom na hua usay kya hua. Mera khayal hai ke wo giroh choohay hain, maskh ho kar. Kya tum nahi dekhtay ke jab choohon ke liye oont ka doodh rakha jaye to wo nahi peetay aur jab bakri ka doodh rakha jaye to pee letay hain? Goya daleel ye hai ke choohay Bani Israil ke wo log hain jo maskh hue thay chahe wo zinda na rahay hon, is liye ke Bani Israil ki shariat mein oont ka gosht aur oont ka doodh haraam tha. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main ne ye hadees Ka'b se bayan ki to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne ye Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suni hai? Main ne kaha: Haan. Phir unhon ne kai baar poocha, to main ne kaha: Kya main Tauraat padhta hun? Jo is mein dekh kar main ne ye riwayat hasil ki ho, mera to sara ilm Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hua hai. Aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne jawab diya: Kya mujh par Tauraat naazil hoti hai jis se padh kar main tumhein batata hun? (Muslim)."
"1505","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jabke aik mard rastay mein chal raha tha aur us par pyaas sakht ho gayi. To us ne kuan paya. To wo us mein utra aur piya, phir nikla. To achanak kutta haanp raha tha aur pyaas se mitti kha raha tha. To us mard ne kaha: Beshak is kuttay ko pyaas se wohi pahuncha hai jo mujhe pahuncha tha. To wo kunwein mein utra aur apna moza pani se bhara, phir usay apne munh se pakray raha yahan tak ke upar chadha. To us ne kuttay ko pilaya. To Allah ne us ka shukr ada kiya aur usay bakhsh diya. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya beshak hamaray liye in maweshiyon mein ajar hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Har taaza jigar mein ajar hai. (Muslim: 7/44). (Murad ye hai ke oont ka gosht aur doodh Bani Israil par bakri ke gosht aur doodh ke siwa haraam thay, to choohon ka oont ka doodh na peena is ki daleel hai.)"
